globs: src/**/__tests__/**,e2e/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# Tests

- Name specs `*.spec.ts`.
- Put a new unit spec next to the module (`src/{lib,composables,views,components,stores}/**/__tests__/`).
- `src/__tests__/` is only Vitest setup and app-level specs — do not add module tests there.
- E2E specs live in `e2e/`.
